  "limitations": [
    "Reads a scenario (.chk) on its own — extracted from a map, opened as the staredit\\scenario.chk entry of one, or a campaign scenario of the Remastered storage — with the same section rules, tree, players, layers and terrain as blizzard/starcraft1-map; its tileset is found in the storage it lies in (enclosing container), beside it (sibling directory) or behind it (workspace dependency layer). A layer write is a plan replacing the scenario's bytes.",
    "Strings are read as UTF-8 when valid, as Remastered does; other strings are decoded with the textEncoding setting (a WHATWG label, default windows-1252) — the map does not record its code page, so it is not guessed."
  ],
  "spec": {
